## Strata Cloud Manager (SCM) Example Usage

When `scm_enabled = true`, the firewall is managed by Strata Cloud Manager
instead of Panorama. SCM mode requires `license_type = "BRING_YOUR_OWN"`,
`routing_type = "advanced"`, and PAN-OS `version >= 10.2.3`.
`scm_enabled` is mutually exclusive with `panorama_enabled`.

